Two independent faults in two files of one package: discover returns the
source-earliest diagnostic (a.go before b.go), deterministically, no matter what
order the loader presents the files. Guards the traversal ordering in Analyze.
Without it, which fault surfaces flips with load order.
-- config --
import-path: example.com/app
package-name: app
error-is: ErrInvalidSetName
-- example.com/app/a.go --
package app

//plumb:build extra
func A() int { return 0 }
-- example.com/app/b.go --
package app

//plumb:build
const B = 1
